  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK granskning Svenska R&#xf6;da Korset SRK 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review Swedish Red Cross (SRC) 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma systemet f&#xf6;r intern kontroll genom hela niv&#xe5;erna f&#xf6;r vidarebefordran av medel; SRK och NS:er som genomf&#xf6;r programmet. 
Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter. Baserat p&#xe5; resultaten kommer Sida att kr&#xe4;va att SRK &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rdar svagheterna p&#xe5; l&#xe4;mpligt s&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;re eller under avtalsfasen. Vissa av &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rderna kan ing&#xe5; som avtalsvillkor som ska f&#xf6;ljas upp vid den &#xe5;rliga revisionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at assessing the system for internal control throughout the levels forwarding of funds; SRC and the NSs implementing the programme. The consultant is expected to identify eventual weaknesses. Based on the findings, Sida will require that SRC addresses the weaknesses as appropriate before or during the agreement phase. Some of the measures might be included as agreement conditions to be followed up during the annual audit.</narrative>
  </description>
